    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Import your flowchart from your **Backpack** into your project, then add it as context to the AI.\r\n\r\n2. Ask the AI to write the code to implement the logic in the flowchart.\r\n\r\n2. Check that the code matches your flowchart:\r\n\r\n   - **If the cart has at least 1 item:** the cart notification should appear and show the correct item total\r\n   - **If the cart has 0 items:** the cart notification should be hidden\r\n\r\n3. If something is incorrect, explain what the AI got wrong and ask it to revise the code so it matches your flowchart exactly.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
